  npcName: Ms. Galina
  promptText: '[E] Talk'
  dialogueLines:
  - Zdravstvuyte! Need a refreshing drink? Come try our cold, authentic Kvass!
  - Kvass is our traditional Slavic fermented drink brewed from toasted rye bread.
  - Russians have enjoyed it since ancient medieval times  it's tangy, fizzy, and naturally energizing!
